    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Lead Qualification 2: Hot Lead Approval\n## A hot lead has an AI reply draft. You decide in Telegram if it goes out: one click on Send or Discard.\n## This workflow starts by that click, checks that the lead is still open, sends or drops the draft and updates the Telegram message and Airtable.\n\n### **Flow:** button click → read click → load lead → still open? → Send: mail + mark sent / Discard: mark discarded → update message → close the click.\n\n- **Key decision:** Nothing waits for your click. The main workflow ends after sending the buttons, your click starts a new run, even hours later.\n- **Safeguard:** A second click on the same message does nothing (\"already handled\").\n- **Data protection:** The Telegram message shows no personal data, only a link to the Airtable record.\n\n- **Workflow settings:** Error workflow 3, timezone Europe/Berlin, execution timeout 120 seconds. Only clicks from your own chat count.\n- **Next step:** Edit the draft before sending.",
        "height": 368,
        "width": 2000,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "4adb82cf-6857-4337-b693-e83aa0510391",
      "name": "Note Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -992
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 1. Click arrives and is checked",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 1580,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f39aa295-0f9d-4ac7-a261-e91fdac73e9d",
      "name": "Band A",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -144,
        -576
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
