      "name": "Band B",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1472,
        -576
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## telegram_approval_trigger\n### What happens:\n- Starts when you press a button in Telegram.\n### Why:\n- Your click is the approval.\n### Settings:\n- Only button clicks, only your own chat.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "90192b4e-be0b-4835-939b-fdfe3698c150",
      "name": "Note telegram_approval_trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -144,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## parse_approval_click\n### What happens:\n- Reads which button you pressed and which lead it belongs to.\n### Why:\n- The button carries `send:<record id>` or `discard:<record id>`.\n### Output:\n- `aktion` / `recordId` / `queryId` / `chatId` / `messageId`",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "22eeccf8-fec2-4b88-8cc8-b25c127f0f08",
      "name": "Note parse_approval_click",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        272,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## load_lead\n### What happens:\n- Loads the lead and its reply draft from Airtable.\n### Why:\n- The draft stays in Airtable, not in the button.\n### Settings:\n- Retry On Fail (3 tries, 5000 ms).",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "537af640-ce8f-405f-b7fc-18f053683425",
      "name": "Note load_lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        672,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## still_open\n### What happens:\n- IF the field `antwort-status` is empty -> go on.\n- IF not -> already handled.\n### Why:\n- Stops double sending when you click twice.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "63e0a7d0-ebed-4cdc-bc44-f993c307b843",
      "name": "Note still_open",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1072,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## telegram_already_handled\n### What happens:\n- Shows the pop-up \"already handled\" and does nothing else.\n### Why:\n- Clear feedback for a second click.",
        "height": 438,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5f49cfa6-c41e-42ad-8797-047d370452f5",
      "name": "Note telegram_already_handled",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1072,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## is_send\n### What happens:\n- IF `aktion` is send -> mail the draft.\n- IF not -> mark as discarded.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d1b4d887-ea7c-4e14-863d-db845cf100c3",
      "name": "Note is_send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1472,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## send_reply_mail\n### What happens:\n- Sends the approved draft to the lead.\n### Why:\n- A person approved every AI text before it leaves.\n### Settings:\n- Retry On Fail (3 tries, 5000 ms).",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ffc44a05-64d3-4757-8f5b-aa213d7c47ee",
      "name": "Note send_reply_mail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1872,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## mark_sent\n### What happens:\n- Writes `gesendet` into `antwort-status`.\n### Why:\n- Marks the lead as handled for the next click.\n### Settings:\n- Retry On Fail (3 tries, 5000 ms).",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "6db984e2-cd8d-462f-a421-1f0fac09a6ca",
      "name": "Note mark_sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2272,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## mark_discarded\n### What happens:\n- Writes `verworfen` into `antwort-status`. No mail.\n### Why:\n- Same lock as for sending.\n### Settings:\n- Retry On Fail (3 tries, 5000 ms).",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "32886f3a-7d98-4b28-b696-7d8d679df407",
      "name": "Note mark_discarded",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2096,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## telegram_result\n### What happens:\n- Changes your Telegram message to \"reply sent\" or \"reply discarded\", with the link to the lead.\n### Why:\n- The buttons disappear, no second click.\n### Settings:\n- Parse mode HTML, Retry On Fail (3 tries, 5000 ms).",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "9f0137ea-9797-4f72-9591-9ced1a3ea4f1",
      "name": "Note telegram_result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2672,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## telegram_ack_click\n### What happens:\n- Closes the click with the short note \"done\".\n### Why:\n- Without it the button keeps spinning in Telegram.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3b13c49c-3a5b-4bd0-970b-cb9cf3821c5c",
